What was fixed
SQLSTATE[HY000] General error: 25 (SQLITE_RANGE)
Root cause: array_unique() preserves original array keys. If you have 3 copies of movies [5, 5, 7], array_unique returns [0=>5, 2=>7]. PHP PDO uses the key as the 1-based SQLite bind index — so it tries to bind at index 3 for a 2-? query → SQLITE_RANGE. Fix: array_values(array_unique(...)).

Also fixed:

Empty values[] in a section now means "match any item with a value for this type" (previously returned false, breaking all presets)
Operator-precedence bug in the fill loop condition
Shelf capacity clamped to max(1, ...)
Clear API errors when collection is empty or no shelves exist
