Added $umdbMovieIdCache — an in-loop map of movie_db_id → umdb_movie_id. When edition 1 creates the movie and gets umdb-xxx back, that ID is stored in the cache. Editions 2 and 3 find it in the cache and use movie_id: umdb-xxx directly — no need to create the movie again.

